on is managed with metformin 500 mg, and her latest Alc was 6.1%.\n\nThe patient reported feeling with no new complaints. Her chronic conditions are being well managed, and she continues to follow her prescribed treatment regimens.\n\nAdditional Information:\nA1C trend: The A1c readings over the past year have been as follows: 6.2% in December 2025, 6.3% in March 2025, and 6.5% in May 2024.\n\nExercise: Mrs. Adams is noted to run 3-4 times per week, which is a commendable exercise routine contributing to her overall well-being.\n\nSocial History: Mrs. Adams has a history of tobacc"
